  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: \"0.17.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: runai-model-streamer\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  - url: https://github.com/run-ai/runai-model-streamer/archive/refs/tags/${{ version }}.tar.gz\n    sha256: 55c64c86df87ebb6891662cb81908e4d055527231cdea9749f120fe29e75ef2e\n    patches:\n      - 0001-Build-core-libstreamer-with-conda-toolchain.patch\n      - 0003-freeres-noop-with-dynamic-libstdcxx.patch\n      - 0004-use-conda-forge-liburing-and-libaio.patch\n      - 0005-drop-libaio-version-node.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  # Upstream only builds on Linux (x86_64/aarch64): the Bazel C++ toolchain and\n  # the bundled libstreamer.so are Linux/GNU specific (no macOS/Windows support).\n  skip:\n    - not linux\n  script: build.sh\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - bazel 7.*\n  host:\n    - python\n    - pip\n    - setuptools >=70.1\n    - wheel\n    - liburing\n    - libaio\n    # cuda-cudart-dev: cuda.h only, the CUDA driver is dlopen'd at runtime.\n    - cuda-cudart-dev\n  run:\n    - python\n    - pytorch >=2.0.0,<3.0.0\n    - numpy\n    - humanize\n    - liburing\n    - libaio\n  ignore_run_exports:\n    # cuda.h is a compile-time-only dependency: libcuda.so is dlopen'd at\n    # runtime, so neither the CUDA runtime nor the driver is needed to run this.\n    from_package:\n      - cuda-cudart-dev\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - runai_model_streamer\n      pip_check: true\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/run-ai/runai-model-streamer\n  summary: Python SDK that streams model files concurrently into host memory to speed up model loading.\n  description: |\n    Run:ai Model Streamer is a Python SDK designed to enhance model loading\n    times. It uses multiple threads to read tensors concurrently from a file in\n    local or object storage (S3, GCS, Azure) into CPU memory. The core\n    streaming engine is implemented in C++ (built with Bazel) and loaded via\n    ctypes.\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  repository: https://github.com/run-ai/runai-model-streamer\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - xhochy\n",
